Art. 4.—The authorities on whom I rely are minutely specified in my 'History of Musical Pitch' in the *Journal of the Society of Arts* for 5 March and 2 April 1880, and 7 Jan. 1881. The two last papers contained indispensable corrections and additions. In the privately @@R@@
>>>
